| Cementation Exponent | $m$ | {{ sw_params.m }} | unitless | Formation Factor ($F = a / \phi^m$) |
| Saturation Exponent | $n$ | {{ sw_params.n }} | unitless | Resistivity Index ($RI = S_w^{-n}$) |
| Formation Water Resistivity | $R_w$ | {{ "%.3f"|format(sw_params.rw) }} | $\Omega\cdot\text{m}$ | Water Zone Pickett $S_w = 100\%$ Ro Trend |
| Formation Temperature | $T_{res}$ | {{ "%.1f"|format(sw_params.temp) }} | $^\circ\text{C}$ | {{ sw_params.temp_basis }} |
| Free Water Level | $FWL$ | {{ "%.1f"|format(sw_params.fwl) }} | $\text{m TVDss}$ | {{ sw_params.fwl_basis }} |
{% if sw_params.model_key == 'waxman_smits' %}
| Clay Counter-Ion Conductance | $B$ | {{ sw_params.b_conductance }} | $\text{L}\cdot\text{equiv}^{-1}\cdot\Omega^{-1}\cdot\text{m}^{-1}$ | Juhasz (1981) Empirical Model @ $T_{res}$ & $R_w$ |
| Cation Exchange Capacity / Pore Vol | $Q_v$ | {{ sw_params.qv }} | $\text{meq/mL}$ | {{ sw_params.qv_method }} |
| Shale Porosity | $\phi_{sh}$ | {{ sw_params.phish }} | $\text{v/v}$ | Clay-Bound Water ($CBW$) Partitioning Endpoint |
